# Ends one combat case. Set $must to something A's own log has to contain - proof the case really played
# on A - before including. Then the puppet on B must have played exactly what A played: the same actions, from
# the same binds, in the same order, the same combo steps, the same charged swings and stance changes.
# Timings are left out (a copy's hold differs by a frame or two); a missing, extra or swapped action is not.
sleep 4
A expect actlog brief contains "$must" timeout=10
A wait actlog=* timeout=5
B expect actlog brief == $A.actlog timeout=10
